      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three consecutive May 20 tornadoes struck Codell in 1916, 1917, and 1918, with the 1918 F4 storm destroying church, hotel, and homes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
