      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Codell%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1938 WPA project built a limestone school and Cougar Gymnasium, replacing the original high school that never fully recovered from the 1918 tornado.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
